      "value": "I wouldnt put the blame on someone using the avatar as they may not know that the avatar causes effects, like people cloning avatars. Now someone who does it intentionally to cause epeleptic seizures should be reported.\n\nBut yeah, its best to have more shader options without ruining textures on the avatars, which currently does atm.",
